Salamanca.</li>
<li>Jon-Lark Kim, Department of Mathematics, University of Louisville</li>
<li>Patrick Fiztpatrick, University College, Cork</li>
<li>Edgar Mart&iacute;nez-Moro, Universidad de Valladolid </li>
<li>Diego Ruano, Technical University of Denmark</li>
