<td valign="top"><b>Session Title</b></td>
<td><em><a href="http://theory.sinp.msu.ru/~edneral/ACA2008/DSsession.html">Computer Algebra for Dynamical Systems, and Celestial Mechanics</a></em></td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td valign="top"><b>Session Organization</b></td>
<td>
  <table>
  <tr><td><a href="mailto:edneral@theory.sinp.msu.ru">Victor Edneral</a>, Moscow State University, Russia  </td></tr>
  <tr><td><a href="mailto:alemio@utu.fi">Aleksandr Myllari</a>, University of Turku, Finland  </td></tr>
  <tr><td><a href="mailto:vasiliev@pdmi.ras.ru">Nikolay Vassiliev</a>, Steklov Institute of Mathematics at St.Petersburg, Russia  </td></tr>
